+`late_fee` in src/billing.sh multiplies the invoice amount by `fee_rate` / 100.
+`fee_rate` (src/config.sh) returns `LATE_FEE_PCT`, which defaults to 7 (percent).
+No fee is charged while days overdue is within `GRACE_DAYS` (default 5).
+`invoice_total` adds the fee to the amount.
